{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2070. A lunar mining operation picks up a mysterious signal emanating from the inside of the moon. Once the signal is discovered, all the automatons and electronic systems in the operation go haywire, killing a large portion of the base\u2019s inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A team of highly specialized operatives from all over the world are called in to investigate the disturbance and find the cause. What they discover through this journey into the unknown will change the course of human history. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they descend through the world inside the moon they are confronted with twisted reflections of civilization, structures, and mythology we know to be our own. Are they being tested, or punished for the nature of humanity? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where will this descent take them, and what lies at the bottom? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descent of Lunaris is a love letter to classic dungeon-crawling RPGs of the past. Descend into the depths and find the source of the signal that summoned your mission. Not everything is as it seems...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/124b76f7260e38523a2e1a48322eaf83.poster.avif?t=1768940910\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/124b76f7260e38523a2e1a48322eaf83.webm?t=1768940910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/124b76f7260e38523a2e1a48322eaf83.mp4?t=1768940910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\u00a0- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\u00a0- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the moon in this classic inspired grid-based dungeon crawling RPG. Customize your party at the moon base and explore the dungeon levels to find what lies in waiting beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet Strange Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/1a9e22e3a139491554e0f5b81c0fac2f.poster.avif?t=1768940910\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/1a9e22e3a139491554e0f5b81c0fac2f.webm?t=1768940910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and befriend allies or make enemies within each dungeon for access to more loot, rewards, and information that will aid in your exploration of new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your Perfect Team</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/73b392c2cc7b62ede264876bae4710e3.poster.avif?t=1768940910\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/73b392c2cc7b62ede264876bae4710e3.webm?t=1768940910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/73b392c2cc7b62ede264876bae4710e3.mp4?t=1768940910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your operatives' abilities, unlock new subclasses, change up your gear, and upgrade your characters to customize your play experience and tackle your enemies in a style that suits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive First-Person Exploration\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/8d5f82f783ca543714582c6dc4ef153a.poster.avif?t=1768940910\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/8d5f82f783ca543714582c6dc4ef153a.webm?t=1768940910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/8d5f82f783ca543714582c6dc4ef153a.mp4?t=1768940910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through the world beneath the lunar surface and explore the dungeons to find out what lies beneath. Defeat powerful enemies to level up your team and gain access to new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat Encounters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/45bbec47f8366d41c3d51d0efd59973b.poster.avif?t=1768940910\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/45bbec47f8366d41c3d51d0efd59973b.webm?t=1768940910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/45bbec47f8366d41c3d51d0efd59973b.mp4?t=1768940910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through enemy encounters with traditional formation combat and tactical grid based combat. Strategize your encounters to protect your team and get the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- - - - -\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to see what lies beneath?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3824720?t=1768940910","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3824720?t=1768940910","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/4c9bf732b95f25c391ca4e2a50dcbd0989b07acb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768940910","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/4c9bf732b95f25c391ca4e2a50dcbd0989b07acb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768940910","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2070. A lunar mining operation picks up a mysterious signal emanating from the inside of the moon. Once the signal is discovered, all the automatons and electronic systems in the operation go haywire, killing a large portion of the base\u2019s inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A team of highly specialized operatives from all over the world are called in to investigate the disturbance and find the cause. What they discover through this journey into the unknown will change the course of human history. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they descend through the world inside the moon they are confronted with twisted reflections of civilization, structures, and mythology we know to be our own. Are they being tested, or punished for the nature of humanity? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where will this descent take them, and what lies at the bottom? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descent of Lunaris is a love letter to classic dungeon-crawling RPGs of the past. Descend into the depths and find the source of the signal that summoned your mission. Not everything is as it seems...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/124b76f7260e38523a2e1a48322eaf83.poster.avif?t=1768940910\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/124b76f7260e38523a2e1a48322eaf83.webm?t=1768940910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/124b76f7260e38523a2e1a48322eaf83.mp4?t=1768940910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\u00a0- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\u00a0- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the moon in this classic inspired grid-based dungeon crawling RPG. Customize your party at the moon base and explore the dungeon levels to find what lies in waiting beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet Strange Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/1a9e22e3a139491554e0f5b81c0fac2f.poster.avif?t=1768940910\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/1a9e22e3a139491554e0f5b81c0fac2f.webm?t=1768940910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and befriend allies or make enemies within each dungeon for access to more loot, rewards, and information that will aid in your exploration of new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your Perfect Team</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/73b392c2cc7b62ede264876bae4710e3.poster.avif?t=1768940910\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/73b392c2cc7b62ede264876bae4710e3.webm?t=1768940910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/73b392c2cc7b62ede264876bae4710e3.mp4?t=1768940910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your operatives' abilities, unlock new subclasses, change up your gear, and upgrade your characters to customize your play experience and tackle your enemies in a style that suits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive First-Person Exploration\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/8d5f82f783ca543714582c6dc4ef153a.poster.avif?t=1768940910\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/8d5f82f783ca543714582c6dc4ef153a.webm?t=1768940910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/8d5f82f783ca543714582c6dc4ef153a.mp4?t=1768940910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through the world beneath the lunar surface and explore the dungeons to find out what lies beneath. Defeat powerful enemies to level up your team and gain access to new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat Encounters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/45bbec47f8366d41c3d51d0efd59973b.poster.avif?t=1768940910\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/45bbec47f8366d41c3d51d0efd59973b.webm?t=1768940910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/45bbec47f8366d41c3d51d0efd59973b.mp4?t=1768940910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through enemy encounters with traditional formation combat and tactical grid based combat. Strategize your encounters to protect your team and get the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- - - - -\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to see what lies beneath?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Unison Games"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/7aae15694afa395a4d666d295dc138b5d5392ad4/header.jpg?t=1768940910","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3824720/1358123304/09b262cbe20f7f043b5075c8c87f9df543d363f6/1764602605/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764604038","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3824720/1358123304/09b262cbe20f7f043b5075c8c87f9df543d363f6/176460